  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support ICF led activities by NIUA on setting up of a Technical Support Unit ensuring implementation of Disabled friendly Cities guidelines in Indian cities and to Operationalise the Learning platform on India&apos;s National Urban Innovation Hub .</narrative>
